    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21422" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαῖσος</span></b> , ὁ (or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαῖσον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
			Ph.
			<u>Bel.</u>
			99.16
		</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
			<u>AB</u>
			88
		</span></i>), a sort of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>javelin</i>, <i><span class="en">
